loyee Benefits compared to similar employers and is a reflection of Spring Arbor\n                     University's commitment in supporting the health, wellbeing, and financial security\n                     of our employees. Review Job Postings Please take a moment to review our employment opportunities . To ensure a seamless application experience , kindly review the Spring Arbor University Statement of Beliefs , have your documents ready , and complete the entire application in one session . (Please note that exiting the window will result in loss of data.) Contact Us If you have questions, please call the Office of Human Resources at (800) 968-0011\n                     ext. 1576 or email [email protected] . More Resources Human Resources Intercultural Engagement EEO Policy 106 E. Main St. Spring Arbor, MI 49283 517.750.6684 Explore SAU Visit Campus Careers at SAU Request a Transcript Athletics Community Alumni Giving News Events On Our Campus Home.fm Physical Therapy Wagner Faith and Freedom Center SAU Campus Store White Library facebook instagram x-twitter tiktok linkedin youtube @springarboru Equal Employment Opportunity Title IX Policy Privacy Policy Student's Right to Know Complaint Resolution Conditions of Use © 2026 Spring Arbor University ©"
